# PNGs are review-only: they exist so a figure can be eyeballed quickly, and
# `make` regenerates them from the sources beside them. The SVGs are committed
# because those are what goes into the report, and because a reader who clones
# this repository should get the figures without installing Docker or draw.io.
*.png
drawio/*.png

# PlantUML in Docker writes a Java font cache into $HOME. The Makefile sets
# HOME=/tmp, but a direct `docker run` without it creates a literal "?" folder
# here. Ignored so it can never be committed by accident.
\?/
